The fix involves combining the `COBS_FLAG_TRAILING_DELIMITER` with the `test->flags` (which contains the specific delimiter setting for each test item) when initializing the encoder and decoder. This ensures that the encoder and decoder operate with the correct delimiter for each test case, allowing for accurate encoding and decoding in the streaming scenario.

